---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="No signal"
  description="You are offline. Pages you have already opened are still readable."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[46rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <span class="text-6xl" aria-hidden="true">🌥️</span>
    <h1
      class="mt-5 font-display font-900 leading-[1.08]"
      style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.6vw, 3rem);"
    >
      No signal out here
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-soft">
      This page has not been opened on this device yet, so there is no copy saved. Anything you have
      already read is still available offline — including the checklists, which are the part you
      actually need while standing in the garden.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center mt-7">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="location.reload()">Try again</button>
      <a href="/curriculum/" class="btn btn-ghost">Back to the path</a>
    </div>

    <p class="note mt-7">
      Tip: open the phase you are working on while you still have signal, and it stays readable out
      there.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
